From 60952c2cf34df43489adc9a1a0c2e36b6f4aa89a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jagpal Singh Gill <jagpalgill@fb.com>
Date: Wed, 01 Apr 2026 00:27:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] valve-monitor: add analog valve support

Add AnalogValve implementation for monitoring analog valves in liquid
cooling systems. This includes:

- AnalogValve: reads ADC feedback voltage and writes DAC setpoint
  voltage to control valve position. Uses OpenThreshold to determine
  valve open/close state.
- BaseValve: extracted common valve logic from GPIOValve into a base
  class shared by both GPIOValve and AnalogValve.
- ValveFactory: creates the appropriate valve type based on the
  Entity Manager configuration interface.
- LocalConfig: reads per-valve flow rate configuration from a JSON
  file and watches for changes.
- Systemd target integration: starts systemd targets on valve
  open/close state transitions.

